WEBVTT

00:04:27.657 --> 00:04:30.845
Life on this planet
shares a common origin,

00:04:30.869 --> 00:04:35.922
and I can summarize 3.5 billion years
of the history of life on this planet

00:04:35.946 --> 00:04:37.426
in a single slide.

00:04:37.450 --> 00:04:40.926
What you see here are representatives
of all known species in our planet.

00:04:41.321 --> 00:04:44.732
In this immensity of life
and biodiversity,

00:04:44.756 --> 00:04:47.923
we occupy a rather unremarkable position.

00:04:47.947 --> 00:04:48.963
(Laughter)

00:04:48.987 --> 00:04:50.210
Homo sapiens.

00:04:51.016 --> 00:04:52.621
The last of our kind.

00:04:53.570 --> 00:04:56.681
And though I don't really want
to disparage at all

00:04:56.705 --> 00:04:58.676
the accomplishments of our species,

00:04:58.700 --> 00:05:03.686
as much as we wish it to be so
and often pretend that it is,